          "comment": "[Playbook] The agreement contains no insurance covenant even though HDI hosts the Site and handles user information, so we have added a standard insurance paragraph: CGL of $1,000,000 per occurrence / $2,000,000 aggregate, E&O of $2,000,000, cyber and privacy of $5,000,000 where HDI processes our Confidential Information or user data, statutory workers' compensation, and certificates on request. If helpful, our fallback is E&O of $1,000,000 and cyber of $2,000,000.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0070",
              "numbering": "10.9",
              "text": "Insurance. HDI shall maintain, at its own expense, during the term of this Agreement and for one (1) year thereafter: commercial general liability insurance of not less than $1,000,000 per occurrence and $2,000,000 in the aggregate; professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than $2,000,000; where HDI processes the Company's Confidential Information or user data, cyber and privacy liability insurance of not less than $5,000,000; and workers' compensation insurance as required by law. HDI shall provide the Company with certificates of insurance upon request."
            }
